Authoritative, tolerance-controlled manufacturer data are needed for each integrated contra-rotating module under consideration, starting with the Himax CR28161100:
- mounting face, bolt circle and hole pattern;
- shaft diameters and lengths;
- propeller adapters and retention method;
- propeller rotation directions and orientation;
- actual inter-rotor spacing and rotor swept envelopes;
- phase-lead and winding arrangement supporting two independently commanded ESCs;
- mass inclusions and rotating-group mass and inertia.
Human sourcing update e56cba0da1254955ab29bd8cdfa20ddc r1 reports catalogue values: a 43 mm bolt circle, four 3.5 mm holes, a 4 mm front shaft, a 9.5 mm rear shaft and about 164 g including propeller attachments. It also cites an unverified operating manual, but no tolerance-controlled drawing. Provisional CAD may use explicitly labelled assumptions. Mounting compatibility, retention and final selection cannot be claimed until this item is resolved.
